        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 8035M, Egg Knob with Wilshire 7\" Sideplate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Egg Knob with Wilshire Sideplate features classic style with a high-drama silhouette. The 7 inch Wilshire Side Plate is sure to be an eye-catcher on any door. The Egg Knob with Wilshire 7 inch Sideplate is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. Choose from a wide array of finish color options. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Traditional Egg Knob Knobset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits standard door cut outs (2-1/8\" pre-drilled doors).</li>\r\n<li>Knob is surface mounted (rosette screws to the door's face).</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass Knob and trim rose.</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Classic Egg Knob with Wilshire Sideplate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Knob Length: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Width: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Height: 7\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Width: 2-11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Projection: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4 - 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Door knobs on both sides of the door. Package Includes: 2 knobs, 2 roses, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Package Includes: 2 knobs, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside knob will release privacy push button and retract the door latch. Package Includes: 2 knobs, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-10-Finish.jpg?v=1704354500\" width=\"600\" height=\"77\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
