                "description": "The Egg Knob with Wilshire Sideplate features classic style with a high-drama silhouette. The 7 inch Wilshire Side Plate is sure to be an eye-catcher on any door. The Egg Knob with Wilshire 7 inch Sideplate is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. Choose from a wide array of finish color options.",
